╰┈➤SQL versus MySQL
#SQL is the language used to define, query, and modify relational data
# MySQL is a relational database management system that understands SQL and provides storage, users, permissions, transactions, indexes, logging, and server processes
SQL     = language
MySQL   = software/database server
Database = logical container
Table   = structured collection of records
Row     = one record(row represents one customer)
Column  = one attribute(coulmn represents one property)

